OL,3,GNEWSADirect Birmingham-to-Manchester
OL,4,AAirport trains due
OL,5,
OL,6,FA direct train service from Birmingham
OL,7,Fto Manchester Airport is set to be
OL,8,Flaunched next year, it has been
OL,9,Frevealed.
OL,11,FThe London Northwestern Railway (LNR)
OL,12,Fservice will be hourly, with trains
OL,13,Fgoing to the airport starting operation
OL,14,Fin May 2027, running from Birmingham
OL,15,FNew Street through the Black Country,
OL,16,FStaffordshire and Cheshire.
OL,18,FPassengers currently travelling to the
OL,19,Fairport have to change trains at Crewe,
OL,20,FWilmslow or in Manchester city centre.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
