OL,3,GNEWSADirect Birmingham-to-Manchester
OL,4,AAirport trains due
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe direct airport service be the
OL,7,Fsecond of two stages of introduction,
OL,8,Fwith the first starting on 13 December,
OL,9,Fwhen trains will run between Birmingham
OL,10,Fand Crewe, stopping at 12 stations
OL,11,Fincluding Darlaston and Willenhall.
